<title>UK: Willis Corroon year profits 91.6 mln stg.</title>
<headline>Willis Corroon year profits 91.6 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr  (pence)		13.0		   vs 7.0</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	  1.65		   vs 1.65</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence)  6.6		    vs 6.6</p>
<p> Turnover		    730.7		  vs 714.0</p>
<p> Pretax			91.6		   vs 50.2</p>
<p> Operating profits	 87.8		   vs 41.5</p>
<p> Investment income	 45.2		   vs 47.4</p>
<p> Interest payable	  2.2		    vs 7.4</p>
<p> Tax			   36.6		   vs 20.4</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 87.0 and 92.0 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Willis Corroon Group Plc</p>
